<title>USA: LCC Q1 pro forma shr $0.05 vs $0.14.</title>
<headline>LCC Q1 pro forma shr $0.05 vs $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997	1996</p>
<p>REVENUES:</p>
<p>  Service revenues		 $20,224   $17,457</p>
<p>  Product revenues		  14,146     9,631</p>
<p>					  34,370    27,088</p>
<p>COST OF REVENUES:</p>
<p>  Service revenues		  14,780    11,352</p>
<p>  Product revenues		   9,833     6,774</p>
