<p>OPERATING EXPENSES:</p>
<p>  Sales and marketing		1,949     1,432</p>
<p>  General and administrative     3,526     2,655</p>
<p>  Research and development	 1,293	 635</p>
<p>  Non-cash compensation		158	 466</p>
<p>  Depreciation and amortization  1,720     1,213</p>
<p>					   8,646     6,401</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME		    1,111     2,561</p>
<p>OTHER INCOME (EXPENSE):</p>
<p>  Interest income			140	 135</p>
