<p>PRO FORMA INCOME DATA:</p>
<p>  Income before income taxes	 770     3,187</p>
<p>Pro forma provision for</p>
<p>     income taxes			380     1,275</p>
<p>  Pro forma net income		 390     1,912</p>
<p> Pro forma net income per share:  0.05	0.14</p>
<p>NORMALIZED PRO FORMA INCOME DATA:</p>
<p>  Income before income taxes	 770     3,187</p>
<p>  Non-cash compensation		158	 466</p>
<p>    Normalized pre-tax income	928     3,653</p>
