<p>shares used in the calculation</p>
<p>    of per share DATA:	    18,559    15,579</p>
<p>Full company name is LCC International Inc.</p>
<p>NOTES: Excluding the effect of non-cash compensation charges recognized in association with LCC's initial public offering and assuming a 40% effective income tax rate for the prior year, normalized pro forma net income for the first quarter was $0.5 million compared to $2.2 million for Q1 1996, a decrease of $1.7 million or 78%.</p>
